<headroom-rig>
<metadata preset-name="Acid Rat" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="A squelching 303-style acid synth shadows every note and chord you play and is driven with the guitar into an op-amp filter distortion and a blackface combo. Its resonant filter opens on every pick and the pedal fuses the two into one spitting voice. Poly: lines and strums both play; bends stay in the guitar." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
